# {{.Name}}

A JSON API on [gesso](https://github.com/Elagoht/gesso), on {{.DialectName}}.

```sh
go mod tidy
gesso add module notes -fields title:string,body:text,published_on:date
go run .                        # DATABASE_URL={{.DefaultDSN}}
go test ./...
```

`gesso add module` scaffolds a module under `internal/` and adds it to
`internal/api/api.go`, which opens the database, runs every module's
migrations and builds the app. The OpenAPI document is at `/openapi.json`.
